    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>AnowRadio Player allows you to embed a beautiful radio player widget on your WordPress website.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Easy API integration</li>\n<li>Shortcode support</li>\n<li>Player and On-Air widget</li>\n<li>Works with any AnowRadio powered station</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Go to Settings &gt; AnowRadio Player</li>\n<li>Enter your API URL and API Key</li>\n<li>Use shortcode [anowradio] in any page or post</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"how%20do%20i%20get%20an%20api%20key%3F\">\nHow do I get an API key?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Contact your radio station admin to get API credentials.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20shortcode%20options%20are%20available%3F\">\nWhat shortcode options are available?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>[anowradio] &#8211; Full widget<br />\n[anowradio player=&#8221;1&#8243; onair=&#8221;0&#8243;] &#8211; Player only<br />\n[anowradio player=&#8221;0&#8243; onair=&#8221;1&#8243;] &#8211; On-Air only</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Embed radio player widget on your WordPress site using API key.",
